        "sid": "2KI 7"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "7",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 7:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasaa Eliishaa yidhi, War maqla erayga Rabbiga. Rabbigu wuxuu leeyahay, Berrito hadda oo kale Samaariya iriddeeda koombo bur ah waxaa lagaga iibin doonaa sheqel, oo laba koombo oo shaciir ahna waxaa lagaga iibin doonaa sheqel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.7.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 7:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo sirkaalkii gacantiisa boqorku ku tiirsanaa wuxuu ninkii Ilaah ugu jawaabay, Rabbiga oo samada daaqado ka fura mooyaane, ee sidee baa waxanu ku noqon karaan? Oo isna wuxuu ku yidhi, Bal ogow, indhahaaga waad ku arki doontaa, laakiinse waxba kama cuni doontid.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.7.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Samaariya Oo Hareerayntii Laga Qaaday",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 7:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.7.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 7:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haddaba iridda magaalada laga soo galo waxaa joogay afar nin oo baras qabay; oo iyana midba kii kaluu ku yidhi, War maxaynu halkan u fadhinnaa ilaa aynu ka dhimanno? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.7.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 7:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haddaynu nidhaahno, Aan magaalada galno, de markaasna magaaladii waa abaar, oo kolleyba halkaasaynu ku dhimanaynaa. Oo haddaynu halkan iska fadhinnona waynu dhimanaynaa. Haddaba ina keena oo aynu ciidanka Suuriya u baxno; oo hadday na bixiyaan, waynu noolaan, hadday na dilaanna kolleyba waynu dhiman lahayn. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.7.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 7:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo markaasay fiidkii kaceen inay tagaan xeradii ciidanka Suuriya, oo markay yimaadeen dibadda sare oo xeradii ciidankii Suuriya waxay arkeen inaan ciduna halkaas joogin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.7.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 7:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maxaa yeelay, Sayidku wuxuu ciidankii Suuriya maqashiiyey gaadhifardood sanqadhood, iyo fardo sanqadhood, iyo xataa ciidan weyn sanqadhiis; oo waxay isku yidhaahdeen, War boqorkii dalka Israa'iil wuxuu inoo soo kiraystay boqorradii reer Xeed, iyo boqorradii Masar inay inagu soo duulaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.7.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 7:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sidaas daraaddeed way kaceen oo carareen intay fiidkii ahayd. Waxayna ka tageen teendhooyinkoodii, iyo fardahoodii, iyo dameerahoodii, iyo xataa xeradiina siday ahayd; naftoodiina way la carareen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.7.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 7:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo kuwii baraska qabayna markay yimaadeen xeradii dibaddeeda sare ayay teendho galeen, oo wax bay cuneen, waxna way cabbeen, markaasay halkaas ka qaateen lacag, iyo dahab, iyo dhar, oo intay tageen ayay soo qarsadeen; oo haddana way soo noqdeen oo waxay galeen teendho kale, oo halkaasna wax kalay ka qaateen, oo intay tageen ayay soo qarsadeen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.7.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 7:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasay isku yidhaahdeen, War wax wanaagsan ma samaynayno, waayo, maanta waa maalin war wanaagsan, oo annana waynu iska aamusan nahay. Haddaynu sugno ilaa waagu ka beryo hubaal belaayo baa inagu dhici doonta; haddaba ina keena oo aynu xaalkan reerkii boqorka u soo sheegno. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.7.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 7:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sidaas daraaddeed way yimaadeen, oo waxay u dhawaaqeen magaalada iridjoogayaasheedii; oo way u warrameen oo waxay ku yidhaahdeen, Waxaannu galnay xeradii ciidanka Suuriya, oo halkaas ninna ma joogin, codna laguma maqal, laakiinse waxaa joogay fardihii xidhxidhnaa, iyo dameerihii xidhxidhnaa, iyo teendhooyinkii oo sidoodii iska ahaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.7.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 7:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo isna wuxuu u yeedhay iridjoogayaashii, oo iyana waxay saas u soo sheegeen reerkii boqorka ee gudaha joogay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.7.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 7:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasaa boqorkii habeennimadii toosay oo addoommadiisii ku yidhi, Haatan waxaan idin tusayaa wixii ay reer Suuriya nagu sameeyeen. Iyagu way og yihiin inaynu gaajaysan nahay, oo sidaas daraaddeed xeradii way ka baxeen oo duurka ku dhuunteen, oo waxay isyidhaahdeen, Markay magaalada ka soo baxaan ayaynu iyagoo noolnool qabqabanaynaa, oo magaalada ayaynu galaynaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.7.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 7:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo mid addoommadiisii ka mid ahaa ayaa ugu jawaabay, Waxaan kaa baryayaa in qaar wado shan faras oo kuwa magaalada ku hadhay ah, (maxaa yeelay, iyagu waxay la mid yihiin sida dadkii Israa'iil ka hadhay oo dhan, oo waxay la mid yihiin sida dadkii Israa'iil ee le'day oo dhan,) oo aynu dirno iyagu ha soo arkeene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.7.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 7:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo sidaas daraaddeed waxay wadeen laba gaadhifaras iyo fardahoodii; oo boqorkii baa wuxuu ka daba diray ciidankii Suuriya, oo wuxuu ku yidhi, Ordoo soo arka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.7.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 7:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo iyana waxay daba socdeen ilaa Webi Urdun; oo bal eeg jidka oo dhan waxaa ka buuxay dhar iyo weelal ay reer Suuriya iska xooreen intay degdegayeen. Oo wargeeyayaashiina intay soo noqdeen ayay saas boqorkii u soo sheegeen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.7.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 7:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasaa dadkii baxay oo waxay dhaceen xeradii reer Suuriya. Haddaba koombo bur ah waxaa lagu iibiyey sheqel, laba koombo oo shaciir ahna waxaa lagu iibiyey sheqel, oo waxay noqotay sidii erayga Rabbigu ahaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.7.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 7:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasaa boqorkii sirkaalkii uu gacantiisa ku tiirsanaa ku amray inuu iridda u taliyo; laakiinse dadkii baa ku tuntay isagoo iridda jooga, oo wuu dhintay sidii ninkii Ilaah sheegay kolkii boqorku isaga u soo dhaadhacay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.7.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 7:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo waxay noqotay sidii ninkii Ilaah boqorkii ula hadlay isagoo leh, Berrito hadda oo kale Samaariya iriddeeda laba koombo oo shaciir ah waxaa lagaga iibin doonaa sheqel, koombo bur ahna waxaa lagaga iibin doonaa sheqel; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.7.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 7:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "oo sirkaalkii baa wuxuu ugu jawaabay ninkii Ilaah, Rabbiga oo samada daaqado ka fura mooyaane, ee sidee baa waxanu ku noqon karaan? Oo isna wuxuu ku yidhi, Bal ogow, indhahaaga waad ku arki doontaa, laakiinse waxba kama cuni doontid. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.7.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 7:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haddaba isagii sidii baa ku dhacday; maxaa yeelay, isagii dadkii baa ku tuntay isagoo iridda jooga oo wuu dhintay.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.7.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.7.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
